      "headline": {
        "en": "Kroll and StepStone launch private credit PIK indicators",
        "zh": "Kroll与StepStone推出私募信贷PIK指标"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Kroll and StepStone Group launched three payment-in-kind indicators within their private credit benchmarks, covering more than 28,000 direct lending instruments, 18,000 deals and 13,000 borrowers with data back to 2012. The indicators measure PIK as a share of interest income, the percentage of loans with an active PIK component and PIK's share of outstanding principal. The firms' data shows non-cash interest at 2.86 per cent of interest income on loans originated globally in the previous 12 months as of 10 October 2026, versus 6.67 per cent across outstanding loans at end-Q2, covering different cohorts and periods.",
        "zh": "Kroll与StepStone Group在其私募信贷基准中推出三项实物支付（PIK）指标，覆盖逾2.8万份直接贷款工具、1.8万笔交易和1.3万名借款人，历史数据可追溯至2012年。这些指标衡量PIK占利息收入的比例、含活跃PIK成分贷款的笔数占比，以及PIK占未偿本金的比例。两家公司的数据显示，截至2026年10月10日，过去12个月全球新发放贷款的非现金利息占利息收入的2.86%，而截至第二季度末未偿贷款的这一比例为6.67%，但两组数据涵盖不同的贷款批次和报告期。"
      },
      "gps": [],
