      "headline": {
        "en": "Treasury says private credit plays vital role in UK economy despite risks",
        "zh": "英国财政部称尽管存在风险，私募信贷在英国经济中仍发挥“关键作用”"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Lord Pitt-Watson, parliamentary secretary at the Treasury, told the Lords that private markets including private credit play a vital role in financing the real economy but bring new vulnerabilities around complexity, leverage, opacity and interconnectedness. He said HM Treasury continues to work closely with regulators. A total of 46 firms are participating in the Bank of England's first stress test of the sector, with findings due in early 2027, using a hypothetical five-year scenario of a four per cent UK economic contraction and interest rates rising to seven per cent.",
        "zh": "英国财政部议会秘书Lord Pitt-Watson在上议院表示，包括私募信贷在内的私募市场在为实体经济提供融资方面发挥关键作用，但也带来复杂性、杠杆使用、不透明性以及与其他金融体系互联性等新的脆弱性。他表示英国财政部继续与监管机构密切合作。共有46家机构参与英国央行对该行业的首次压力测试，结果预计于2027年初公布；测试设定了英国经济收缩4%、利率升至7%的五年假设情景。"
      },
